:: ===========================================================================
:: ligurian.sca — Solar Speech (Sauleis Bazdā) -> Heart Speech (Mazdō-yō Heardō̃)
:: for the conlang "Ligurian" (Snapshots of the Labyrinth).
::
:: This encodes the REGULAR, context-free + single-context subset of the
:: Vulgar->Heart sound changes (Phases II-V). Stress-conditioned vowel breaking
:: (Phase VI: a>ao, e>ea, o>uo in stressed open syllables) and several
:: cluster/ending rules require syllable+stress structure beyond a segmental
:: rewriter and are intentionally NOT modeled here.
::
:: Notation:  FROM > TO / PRE _ POST
::   #  = word boundary       (empty side of _ = any)      empty TO = deletion
::   V  = a vowel class (expanded host-side to its members)
:: ===========================================================================

class V = a e i o u ā ē ī ō ū

:: --- Phase II: word-initial single stops & sibilant -----------------------
p > b / # _
t > d / # _
k > g / # _
b > m / # _
d > n / # _
s > h / # _

:: --- Phase III: the drag chain (ORDER MATTERS: ō>ū before ā>ō) -------------
ō > ū
ā > ō
ē > ī

:: --- Phase IV: glide hardening --------------------------------------------
w > v

:: --- Phase Vb: s voicing before a voiced consonant ------------------------
s > z / _ m
s > z / _ n
s > z / _ d
s > z / _ b

:: --- Phase V: intervocalic lenition (stop -> voiced fricative / voicing) ---
s > z / V _ V
p > v / V _ V
b > v / V _ V
d > ð / V _ V
g > ɣ / V _ V
k > ɣ / V _ V
